+# "Openbox", selected by name) and optional software (one checkbox each,
+# sorted in categories). The settings of the live ISO common to both
+# desktops are copied afterwards by shellprocess@live_config. Themes, icons,
+# wallpapers and the desktop settings (packarch-xfce-settings or
+# packarch-openbox, and their dependencies) come from the Packarch
+# repository.
